\newlabel{tab:tokens}{{1}{3}{Input representation versus subject-level accuracy (both feet, subject-wise protocol). Each row is the best configuration we found for that representation, so the comparison is between representations rather than between tuned models. ``Worst fold'' is the lowest validation ROC-AUC across the five folds and exposes the training collapse that raw input produced and that the statistic tokens removed}{table.1}{}}
